.TH VIRT-CLOUD-FETCH "1" "September 2026" "virt-cloud-fetch 26.9" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
virt-cloud-fetch \- manual page for virt-cloud-fetch 26.9
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
usage: virt\-cloud\-fetch [\-h] [\-\-imgdir DIR] [\-\-list] [\-\-fedora VER]
.TP
[\-\-fedora\-uki VER] [\-\-centos VER] [\-\-rhel VER]
[\-\-alma VER] [\-\-ubuntu VER] [\-\-nightly] [\-\-cleanup]
.PP
download cloud images
.SS "options:"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-imgdir\fR DIR
store downloads in DIR (default: \fI\,/vmdisk/iso/distro\/\fP)
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
list cloud images in \fI\,/vmdisk/iso/distro\/\fP
.TP
\fB\-\-fedora\fR VER
download fedora VER
.TP
\fB\-\-fedora\-uki\fR VER
download fedora VER (UKI variant)
.TP
\fB\-\-centos\fR VER
download centos stream VER
.TP
\fB\-\-rhel\fR VER
download rhel VER
.TP
\fB\-\-alma\fR VER
download almalinux VER
.TP
\fB\-\-ubuntu\fR VER
download ubuntu VER
.TP
\fB\-\-nightly\fR
use latest nightly build for rhel
.TP
\fB\-\-cleanup\fR
remove stale images
.SH "محیط (ENVIRONMENT)"

.TP
VIRT_DISTRO_IMGDIR
default cloud image directory
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"

Gerd Hoffmann <kraxel@redhat.com>
